  "description": "MapSharp.NET is a lightweight, high-performance .NET object-to-object mapper with explicit configuration, projection support, typed per-call options, map-into-existing-instance support, IMapper access to IConfigurationProvider, and optional relaxed validation for unmapped destination members.",
